        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LGN150048TEKSS4MBK, 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Laguna Door Pull with Stainless Steel Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis teak door handle is 1.5\" diameter and 48\" long with straight, matte black finished mounts.  It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back to back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions LGN150SS4 Laguna Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Teak</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Mount Finish: Matte Black</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Different Wood Types</b> and <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
